{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e294d6006945d2802e1c","chatId":"950c589c19d14e9c93cb5f4caa02f83c","sessionId":null,"userId":59909,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"[[A]]","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"[[A]]","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":949,"promptTokens":1528,"completionTokens":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:35:48"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.006692849339264817,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e294d6006945d2802e1b","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794368148036,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:35:48","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e294d6006945d2802e1b","chatId":"950c589c19d14e9c93cb5f4caa02f83c","sessionId":null,"userId":59909,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"下面给你提供一段故事，一个问题和若干答案选项，请你根据故事内容和给定的问题，按照常理推测，选择一个最可能的答案选项，并输出答案序号。\n注意：\n（1）请只输出最可能的答案序号，格式为：[[答案序号]]，例如，最可能的答案选项为“A. 手提包”，则输出“[[A]]”；\n（2）请必须从给定的答案选项“A、B、C、D”中选择一个做为最可能的答案作为输出，无论故事中是否提供足够的信息，如果你认为故事里没有足够的信息选出答案，请随机输出“[[A]]”，“[[B]]”，“[[C]]”，“[[D]]”其中之一；\n（3）请只输出在给定的信息下最可能的答案序号，不要输出其他内容。\n\n[故事]\n高考动员会的那天，老师正坐在课堂前方的讲台上，准备向家长传达高考的重要性。小明的妈妈和其他家长坐在后面，热烈地讨论着各种话题。妈妈不时回头看看坐在角落里的小明，然后轻轻对他微笑。小明注意到这个动作，但并没有说话。老师开始介绍，妈妈把注意力集中在他的话上。期间，妈妈不少次把目光转向小明，并嘴角微微上扬。动员会结束后，妈妈留下与老师进一步沟通。\n\n[问题]\n你认为小明在动员会结束后的心情如何？\n\n[答案选项]\nA. 小明有些焦虑，不清楚妈妈和老师在沟通什么内容。\nB. 小明无所谓，他并不在乎妈妈的反应或者意见。\nC. 小明恐惧，害怕妈妈会通过动员会发现他在学校的不良表现。\nD. 小明很快乐，因为他觉得妈妈对他很关注很宠爱。","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.006692849339264817,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e294d6006945d2802e1c","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794368148033,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:35:48","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"86ae7bc87b6b4452bf3d40fa3a40251f"}